  "description": "This stock I estimate will rise more than 170%...",
  "body_html": "<p>We marked our best trade of 2026 on January 29th, selling our silver miner stock, literally the day before silver crashed nearly -40%, cashing in on a +30.6% gain.  On February 20th, I published the article: “<a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/gold-and-silver-are-not-done\">Gold and Silver Are Not Done</a>”…yet it was not time to be buying silver (or miners) again. We were not seeing any strength or breakouts at the time. </p><p>Yet today, there are subtle clues that Gold, Silver and associated miners are set up for yet another run. And the real money, the large percent changes, are in the miners again. </p><h4>Summary</h4><p>The price action to volume reaction are the key clues that Gold, Silver and miners have bottomed. Additionally, key assets share similar chart structures historically and have ran significantly. Gold and silver often times will lag traditional assets, in many ways matching the front runner’s structures. I don’t normally give price targets…so take these values with a huge grain of salt: but I speculate gold will peak well over $6000, possibly over $6500. Silver being more volatile than gold, I predict will climb over 110%, over $170. </p><p>Please note: I will cover gold, as I know there are many “gold bugs” out there, but my focus is on silver. Silver offers more volatility and more % potential returns. They largely run in unison, but silver will pay more. </p><p>Two of the predominant reasons I believe Gold and Silver have significant runway ahead of them:</p><ol><li><p><strong>The longer the consolidation, the longer the runway upwards</strong> (historically). Silver consolidated from 2011 and did not officially break out until October 2025. It maintained a tight range largely between $11 and $31 dollars during that time, only beginning to form higher highs and higher lows right before the pandemic in 2019. The breakouts on the monthly timeframe have barely broken out yet. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!qKdf!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbc884666-2526-48b0-81f6-6aa7200d7957_1497x862.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!qKdf!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbc884666-2526-48b0-81f6-6aa7200d7957_1497x862.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!qKdf!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbc884666-2526-48b0-81f6-6aa7200d7957_1497x862.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!qKdf!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbc884666-2526-48b0-81f6-6aa7200d7957_1497x862.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!qKdf!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbc884666-2526-48b0-81f6-6aa7200d7957_1497x862.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!qKdf!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbc884666-2526-48b0-81f6-6aa7200d7957_1497x862.png\" width=\"1456\" height=\"838\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/bc884666-2526-48b0-81f6-6aa7200d7957_1497x862.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:838,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:139376,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/195031342?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbc884666-2526-48b0-81f6-6aa7200d7957_1497x862.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!qKdf!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbc884666-2526-48b0-81f6-6aa7200d7957_1497x862.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!qKdf!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbc884666-2526-48b0-81f6-6aa7200d7957_1497x862.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!qKdf!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbc884666-2526-48b0-81f6-6aa7200d7957_1497x862.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!qKdf!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbc884666-2526-48b0-81f6-6aa7200d7957_1497x862.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">The longer the consolidation, the bigger the breakout and runaway.</figcaption></figure></div></li><li><p>What gives the dollar value? Its not oil…as demonstrated by Iran accepting trades in alternative currencies, particularly the Yuan. Its not gold for sure. Its <em><strong>faith</strong></em>. Faith in the U.S. Government. Even more specifically, faith that the U.S. Military can ensure the U.S. Government can do whatever it wants (IE strong arm the rest of the world). This is a topic for another article. Now faith in the U.S. Government has been on the decline for decades<a class=\"footnote-anchor\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteAnchorToDOM\" id=\"footnote-anchor-1\" href=\"#footnote-1\" target=\"_self\">1</a>. Yes, this may be upsetting for some of the more patriotic readers, I understand. But put feelings to the side if this is you, and realize that<em><strong> your opinion matters not</strong></em>…<strong>what the world thinks matters.</strong> </p><p>It is not just American’s losing faith, most of the world is losing trust as well.<a class=\"footnote-anchor\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteAnchorToDOM\" id=\"footnote-anchor-2\" href=\"#footnote-2\" target=\"_self\">2</a> The dollar is not “gone” or “obsolete” by any means. Do not get that read from me. However, the trend of losing faith, losing strength, losing accountability, means that many countries, governments, institutions and people themselves will <em><strong>continue</strong></em> to seek alternative “stores of value”. </p></li></ol><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!g3Hf!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F06c54a2f-388f-4910-a0de-19fa8ed4b3c7_742x744.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!g3Hf!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F06c54a2f-388f-4910-a0de-19fa8ed4b3c7_742x744.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!g3Hf!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F06c54a2f-388f-4910-a0de-19fa8ed4b3c7_742x744.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!g3Hf!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F06c54a2f-388f-4910-a0de-19fa8ed4b3c7_742x744.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!g3Hf!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F06c54a2f-388f-4910-a0de-19fa8ed4b3c7_742x744.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!g3Hf!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F06c54a2f-388f-